        <ul>
          <li>Spark is for parents and caregivers, who must be adults.</li>
          <li>Spark is free to use. Spark Plus is an optional auto-renewing subscription billed by Apple.</li>
          <li>Cancel anytime in your App Store settings, at least 24 hours before your renewal date.</li>
